{"id": "t070-028", "text": "voice memo: right so Hiroshi is leaving the Tokyo office and coming to London permanently, start date is the 6th of January, he's bringing his wife and their two kids. Um he asked if I knew any decent schools near Clapham. I said I'd ask around. Remind me to send him the list from Petra on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiroshi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving the Tokyo office", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to London", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 6th of January", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him the list from Petra", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
