{"id": "t070-041", "text": "Had a long catch up with Rebecca after the quarterly review. She's been at the firm eleven years, thinking she might go part time next year to look after her dad, he was diagnosed with Parkinson's in the summer. She hasn't decided yet. She also said her son Oliver has his grade 5 piano exam on 17 November and he's been practising every night. She lives in Didsbury now, moved in August. Remind me to ask how the exam went the week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the quarterly review"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the firm eleven years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go part time", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next year", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Parkinson's", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the summer"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "grade 5 piano exam", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "17 November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Didsbury", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "in August", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the exam went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-042", "text": "Chen's back at work Monday after his mum's discharge. Pop by his desk and see how he's doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "discharge", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pop by his desk and see how he's doing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}]}
