{"id": "t070-044", "text": "Xavier said the review went fine in the end, he's staying on the Ahmed project. He's still looking at other jobs though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Xavier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying on the Ahmed project", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking at other jobs", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t070-045", "text": "Julien and Anil are off to Japan for three weeks over Christmas, leaving the 20th. Julien's mad about ramen, wants recs for Osaka", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anil", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Japan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks over Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 20th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "ramen", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants recs for Osaka", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
