{"id": "t070-051", "text": "Must remember to call Grandad on Sunday, it's his 90th next Saturday and we need to sort who's driving him to the party", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Grandad", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Grandad"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "90th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort who's driving him to the party", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "party", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t070-052", "text": "Felix's little girl Rosie has her nativity play on the 15th, she's a sheep apparently. He's taking the afternoon off for it and his wife's parents are driving down from Durham the night before. Felix said he's been up till midnight helping make the costume out of an old fleece. Remind me to ask him on the 16th how it went and to get a photo, the team will love it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rosie", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nativity play", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down from Durham", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till midnight"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 16th", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a photo", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t070-053", "text": "Jin found Mochi!! She was in the neighbour's shed the whole time. Jin's over the moon", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "found", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t070-054", "text": "Ellie's starting at the design studio on 10th November, leaving us on the 7th. She's excited but a bit nervous about the commute. Remind me to message her at the end of her first week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starting at the design studio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "10th November", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving us", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 7th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous about the commute", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of her first week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-055", "text": "Kemal Khan from procurement — call him back Wednesday re the Andersson contract, he wants the revised figures by Friday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal Khan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from procurement", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him back", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday"}]}
{"id": "t070-056", "text": "dictated: so I spoke to Hiroshi again this afternoon and the school thing is sorted, both kids got places at the one on Lavender Hill, they start after Easter. His wife Yuki is still in Tokyo packing up and flying over on the 3rd of February. He seemed a lot more relaxed. Note that he mentioned he's really into cycling, wants to do the London to Brighton ride next year. Maybe lend him my spare bike in spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiroshi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got places at the one on Lavender Hill", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "start", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after Easter", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yuki", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd of February", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relaxed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cycling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to do the London to Brighton ride", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next year"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "lend him my spare bike", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "in spring", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-057", "text": "Freya's pitch went really well! Client signed on the spot. Buy her a drink Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Freya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pitch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Buy her a drink", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-058", "text": "Petra's brother Tomasz is over from Krakow next weekend, they're doing a big family lunch on Sunday. Alejandro asked if we wanted to come — I said yes, I'm bringing the pierogi from the deli.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomasz", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "over from Krakow", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big family lunch", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alejandro", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t070-059", "text": "Elijah didn't get the promotion. He was pretty flat about it. Take him for a pint next week, don't make a thing of it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elijah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "didn't get the promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t070-060", "text": "Gym, laundry, finish the expenses report. Nothing else today.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "laundry", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "finish the expenses report", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today"}]}
